  "reading": "The discharge signal peaks in MARCH and stays elevated into April and May. Science's precipitation signal peaks December to February. So discharge lags precipitation by roughly a month and persists longer, which is what catchment storage does. The window a reader should watch for high water runs later than the window for heavy rain."
